sequenceDiagram
    actor L as Support lead
    participant G as Gateway
    participant API as Ticket API
    participant BQ as BigQuery
    L->>G: list pending approvals
    G->>API: read pending approvals
    API-->>L: pending list
    L->>G: approve (approval id)
    G->>G: verify lead token, lead is not the requester
    G->>API: decide approval as the lead
    API->>BQ: script: conditional UPDATE pending to approved, must change 1 row
    API->>BQ: re-check order (paid, in window, amount)
    alt re-check fails
        API->>BQ: roll back, mark approval failed
    else re-check passes
        API->>BQ: update order or insert credit, update ticket, set status executed
    end
    API-->>G: result
    G-->>L: result (a second click returns already executed)
